---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { createServicePageSchema } from '../../lib/schema';

const landscapingSchema = createServicePageSchema({
  slug: 'landscaping',
  name: 'Landscaping Services in Gouldsboro, PA | Lawn Care, Mulch, Planting & Weed Control',
  description:
    'ABCO Landscaping provides lawn mowing, weed control, mulch installation, planting, and basic landscape maintenance in Gouldsboro, Eagle Lake, and nearby Northeast PA areas.',
  serviceType: 'Landscaping',
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Landscaping Services in Gouldsboro, PA | Lawn Care, Mulch, Planting & Weed Control"
  description="ABCO Landscaping provides lawn mowing, weed control, mulch installation, planting, and basic landscape maintenance in Gouldsboro, Eagle Lake, and nearby Northeast PA areas."
  canonical="/services/landscaping/"
  image="/images/heros/landscaping-hero.webp"
  schemaJson={landscapingSchema}
>
  <section class="landscape-hero" aria-label="Landscaping Services in Gouldsboro, PA">
    <div class="landscape-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/images/heros/landscaping-hero.webp"
        alt="ABCO Landscaping truck on a Gouldsboro, PA landscaping property"
        class="landscape-hero-img"
        width="1536"
        height="1024"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="landscape-hero-overlay"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container landscape-hero-content">
      <h1>Landscaping Services</h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">
        ABCO Landscaping provides reliable lawn mowing, weed control, mulch installation,
        planting, and basic landscape maintenance for properties in Gouldsboro, Eagle Lake,
        Covington Township, and nearby Pocono communities.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta cta-equal-width" aria-label="Landscaping service actions">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary" title="Request a landscaping estimate">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:+17188771197" class="btn btn-white-outline" title="Call ABCO now">Call Us</a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-subtitle" aria-label="Trust signals">
        Local service <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Fast response <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Fully insured
      </p>

      <nav class="jump-links" aria-label="Jump to page sections">
        <a href="#our-services">Our Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">|</span>
        <a href="#did-you-know">Did You Know</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">|</span>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="our-services" class="services-content section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2 id="services-heading">Lawn Care and Maintenance</h2>
      <p>
        A good-looking property starts with consistent lawn and landscape care. We focus on the
        basics that make the biggest visual impact: clean mowing, neat edges, controlled weeds,
        healthy planting beds, and fresh landscape materials.
      </p>

      <h3 class="services-list-title">Our Landscaping Services Include</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Lawn mowing</li>
        <li>Weed control</li>
        <li>Mulch installation</li>
        <li>Planting</li>
        <li>Landscape bed refreshes</li>
        <li>Lawn care materials</li>
        <li>Stone, soil, and mulch placement</li>
        <li>Basic property beautification</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We can help with one-time upgrades or recurring maintenance based on your property's needs.
      </p>

      <h3>Lawn Mowing</h3>
      <p>
        Regular mowing keeps your property maintained and easier to manage throughout the season.
        We provide mowing for homes, vacation properties, rentals, and small commercial lots,
        including trimming around walkways, edges, and structures for a clean finish.
      </p>

      <h3>Weed Control</h3>
      <p>
        Weeds can quickly overtake lawns, beds, and hardscape edges. ABCO helps control weeds in
        lawn areas, mulch beds, planting beds, walkway edges, and hard-to-maintain zones around
        structures. For many properties in the Poconos, consistent maintenance is more effective
        than waiting until weeds are already out of control.
      </p>

      <h3>Mulching</h3>
      <p>
        Fresh mulch is one of the fastest ways to improve curb appeal. We install mulch around
        trees, shrubs, flower beds, and walkways to create a finished look, reduce weed growth,
        and help soil retain moisture.
      </p>

      <h3>Planting</h3>
      <p>
        We help with practical planting for front beds, borders, walkways, and entry areas.
        For Pocono properties, plant choice matters because deer pressure, shade, rocky soil,
        wet spots, and cold winters all affect long-term success.
      </p>

      <h3>Lawn Care Materials</h3>
      <p>
        We refresh common landscape materials including mulch, topsoil, decorative stone,
        and planting soil. Using the right material in the right location helps reduce upkeep
        and keeps your property cleaner between visits.
      </p>

      <p class="service-note">
        Need regular upkeep? We can set a practical service rhythm that keeps your property clean
        and usable without over-maintenance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="did-you-know" class="did-you-know section" aria-labelledby="did-you-know-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="did-you-know-heading">Did You Know</h2>
      <p class="did-intro">
        Gouldsboro and nearby Pocono properties face unique landscaping challenges. These quick
        notes help explain what works better in this region.
      </p>

      <div class="did-list" role="list">
        <article class="did-item" role="listitem">
          <h3>Deer-resistant does not mean deer-proof</h3>
          <p>
            Deer resistance depends on pressure, weather, and season. Plants like daffodils,
            boxwood, bayberry, holly, and juniper are often better choices, but new plantings
            may still need temporary protection.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="did-item" role="listitem">
          <h3>Mulch can be too deep</h3>
          <p>
            A clean, even mulch layer looks better and performs better than heavy mounding,
            especially around trunks and plant stems where trapped moisture can create issues.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="did-item" role="listitem">
          <h3>Low-maintenance does not mean no-maintenance</h3>
          <p>
            Even simple landscapes still need trimming, weed control, refreshes, and cleanup.
            Good design and material choices reduce maintenance, but they do not eliminate it.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="did-item" role="listitem">
          <h3>Plant choice should match the site</h3>
          <p>
            In the Poconos, cold winters, shade pockets, rocky soil, and wet areas can all change
            what survives. The best results come from matching plants to actual site conditions.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq" class="landscaping-faq section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="faq-heading">Landscaping FAQ</h2>
      <dl class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <p class="faq-kicker">Quick Answer</p>
          <dt>What landscaping services do you offer?</dt>
          <dd>
            We offer lawn mowing, weed control, planting, mulching, lawn care materials,
            and basic landscape maintenance for homes, rentals, cabins, lake properties,
            and small commercial properties.
          </dd>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <p class="faq-kicker">Scheduling</p>
          <dt>Do you offer regular lawn mowing?</dt>
          <dd>
            Yes. We provide lawn mowing for properties in Gouldsboro, Eagle Lake,
            and nearby Pocono communities, with scheduling based on property needs
            and seasonal growth.
          </dd>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <p class="faq-kicker">Curb Appeal</p>
          <dt>Can you install mulch?</dt>
          <dd>
            Yes. We install mulch in foundation beds, flower beds, around shrubs,
            and along walkways. Fresh mulch is one of the fastest ways to improve
            curb appeal and bed definition.
          </dd>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <p class="faq-kicker">Plant Selection</p>
          <dt>Can you help choose deer-resistant plants?</dt>
          <dd>
            Yes. We can suggest practical options for deer-heavy areas. While no plant is
            fully deer-proof, some choices are significantly less attractive to deer.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .landscape-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: min(88vh, 680px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .landscape-hero-media {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .landscape-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 38%;
  }

  .landscape-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      120deg,
      rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.80) 0%,
      rgba(20, 10, 2, 0.55) 55%,
      rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.25) 100%
    );
  }

  .landscape-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-block: 5rem;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .landscape-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6.5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-shadow: 0 3px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  .hero-intro {
    color: #ece7df;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }


  .hero-subtitle {
    color: #ddd5ca;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    max-width: none;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .jump-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .jump-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #f1ede7;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(217, 82, 16, 0.7);
    padding-bottom: 0.1rem;
  }

  .jump-links a:hover { color: #fff; border-bottom-color: #f06520; }

  .jump-links span {
    color: #aba39a;
  }

  .services-content {
    background: #0d0d0d;
  }

  .services-content.prose h2,
  .services-content .prose h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .services-content .prose h3 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .services-content .prose h3::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: -0.1rem;
    width: 34px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: #d95210;
  }

  .services-content .prose h3.services-list-title::after {
    content: none;
  }

  .services-content .prose ul {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    border-left: 4px solid #d95210;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.4rem 1rem 2.2rem;
  }

  .service-note {
    border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    border-left: 4px solid #d95210;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #101010;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    color: #e5dbcf;
  }

  .did-you-know {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, #101010 0%, #0d0d0d 100%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        45deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 8px,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 8px,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 16px
      );
    border-block: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
  }

  .did-you-know h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .did-intro {
    color: #b8b0a7;
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .did-list {
    border-left: 4px solid #d95210;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .did-item {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .did-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .did-item p {
    color: #b8b0a7;
    max-width: 74ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .landscaping-faq {
    background: #0d0d0d;
  }

  .landscaping-faq h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 1.15rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    border-left: 4px solid #d95210;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 100%),
      #121212;
  }

  .faq-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #ffd9c9;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .faq-item dt {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .faq-item dd {
    color: #a09890;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-intro {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .hero-cta .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .jump-links {
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .faq-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .did-item {
      padding: 0.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
